            <div class="gsap-reveal">
                <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center gap-8 lg:gap-12">
                    <div class="lg:w-[70%]">
                        <p class="text-xl md:text-[2rem] font-light leading-snug text-gray-800">
                            Founded as an agile digital studio, ChimpzLab has evolved over the past decade into an
                            AI-powered integrated communications agency. Today, our team of 40 senior strategists,
                            engineers, and creative specialists helps organisations navigate the intersection of
                            corporate
                            reputation, digital infrastructure, and market visibility.
                        </p>
                    </div>
